  "result": "Sub-issues are implemented to the spec, and the full suite passes: 645 of 645 tests, with 617 existing tests unchanged and 28 new. Typecheck and ESLint are clean on the touched files.\n\nChoices the spec left open:\n- **Completion notice event:** it goes through a new domain event, `issue.sub_issues_completed`, which the notification service turns into a `sub_issues_completed` notification via the usual fan-out. The spec didn't name an event.\n- **Depth and cycle checks:** they walk archived sub-issues as well, since they still sit in the tree.\n- **Scope:** I added the service, schema, error and notification pieces only. No server action or UI, since the spec lists only the service API.\n\nNew tests are in `tests/services/issue-hierarchy.test.ts`, with small additions to `tests/lib/errors.test.ts` and `tests/schemas/issue.schema.test.ts`.",
